== Effects ==
* Increases the chance of a {{E|Lil' Battery}} pickup after clearing a room by 6.67%.
* Increases the chance of random pickups being a {{E|Lil' Battery}} by 2%.
* Has a 5% chance to add an extra charge to Isaac's activated item upon completing a room.

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}} / {{t|Watch Battery|r}}: Each copy gives one more extra charge when the 5% chance on room clear triggers.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|Jacob's Ladder}}: Increases arcing distance of sparks.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|AAA Battery}}: Watch Battery triggering after clearing a room will also trigger AAA Battery, provided the activated item was missing exactly 3 charges prior to clearing the room.

